<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Centocor Inc with a strong buy rating.  </p>
<p>-- Set 1997 earnings estimate at $0.47 per share.</p>
<p>-- Set 1998 earnings estimate at $0.96 per share.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-month target price at $52 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-1/4 to 33-7/8.</p>
</text>
